cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research repository, please cite the repository and the exact commit or release you used."
title: "AI Activity Receipt"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gaucher
    given-names: Blake
repository-code: "https://github.com/blakegaucher/ai-activity-receipt"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An independent research repository exploring human-centered,
  provenance-aware records and compact Activity Receipts for consequential
  AI-agent activity. Current public evidence is primarily synthetic and
  technical; the project does not claim proven human benefit, standards
  conformance, legal compliance, or production security.
keywords:
  - AI governance
  - provenance
  - auditability
  - AI agents
  - human-centered AI
